B.SZ=new A.bM(B.f4,["My money was deducted but the order isn't confirmed. What do I do?","If an amount was deducted but you didn't receive an order confirmation, the payment didn't complete verification \u2014 so no order was created and you are not charged. Any such amount is automatically refunded by your bank / UPI app, usually within 5\u20137 working days. If it doesn't reflect back, contact us with your payment reference (UTR / transaction ID)."],t.l)
B.SW=new A.bM(B.f4,["Can I cancel or get a refund after my order is confirmed?",'No. Once the restaurant confirms your order, preparation begins right away \u2014 so a confirmed order cannot be cancelled or refunded. You can cancel only while the order is still in the "Pending" stage (before it is confirmed).'],t.l)
B.T_=new A.bM(B.f4,["How do I cancel an order?",'Open "My Orders" and tap "Cancel Order" while the order is still Pending. Delivery orders are paid online in advance and cannot be self-cancelled \u2014 please call support for those.'],t.l)
B.SY=new A.bM(B.f4,["How do I track my order?",'Go to "My Orders" for live status: Pending \u2192 Confirmed \u2192 Preparing \u2192 Completed (delivery orders also show Prepared \u2192 In Transit \u2192 Delivered).'],t.l)
B.SV=new A.bM(B.f4,["My online payment failed. Was I charged?","A failed payment does not create an order. If any amount shows as deducted, it auto-reverses within a few working days. Just try placing the order again."],t.l)
B.SX=new A.bM(B.f4,["Why can't I pick Dine-in / Takeaway / Delivery right now?","Each order type has its own service hours. A greyed-out option is outside its available time \u2014 the hours are shown beneath it."],t.l)
